        "original_id": "a9bc3069-4d8a-5866-bf3e-8ddad3f9839e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John C. Talbot\n- Organizations: Maine Legislature\n- Places: Augusta, State House\n- Roles: Democrat, Maine House of Representatives, Maine Senate\n\nFacts:\n- John C. Talbot, a Democrat, served in the Maine House of Representatives in 1825.\n- The Maine Legislature has convened at the State House in Augusta since 1832.\n- John C. Talbot served in the Maine House of Representatives again in 1831.\n- John C. Talbot served in the Maine Senate from 1832 to 1833.\n- John C. Talbot served in the Maine Senate again from 1836 to 1837.\n- John C. Talbot served six one-year terms in the Maine Legislature in total.",
